 "remarks": "Welcome to Eastside Commons! Discover comfort, convenience, and modern living in this beautifully designed 2-bedroom, 2-bathroom condominium in downtown Stamford. This freshly painted, bright, and spacious unit features an open-concept layout with high ceilings, abundant natural light, a private balcony, and new carpet in both bedrooms. The kitchen offers granite countertops, stainless steel appliances, and a center island, perfect for everyday living and entertaining. The generous primary suite includes a walk-in closet and private bathroom, while the second bedroom provides additional space and flexibility. Enjoy in-unit laundry and reserved garage parking. Building amenities include concierge service, a fitness center, and a landscaped courtyard with BBQ facilities. Ideally situated near downtown Stamford's restaurants, shopping, entertainment, and major commuter routes, this condo offers a comfortable, convenient, and low-maintenance rental lifestyle. Don't miss the opportunity to make this beautiful condo your next home! The listing agent is related to the owner. Also listed for sale. MLS ID: 24213057.",
